{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-light-blue-or-low-visibility-baby-floats-sold-via-tiktok-2606-0178","content_id":"87f7c881-ea52-4f3f-ba0a-4ec3266e0a25","description":"Product Recall for Light-Blue or Low-Visibility Baby Floats presenting a risk of drowning.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"b4bd1902-6c06-410a-b5c4-33704cb9b50b","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-22T11:19:11+01:00","id":"b4bd1902-6c06-410a-b5c4-33704cb9b50b","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-22T11:19:11+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a390c1fc6e94f095f3efb78/2606-0178-product-recall-low-visibility-baby-floats.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Light-Blue or Low-Visibility Baby Floats sold via TikTok</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk of drowning as low-visibility colours may make it difficult for caregivers or lifeguards to quickly locate the child in the water.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users by TikTok and the listings have been removed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Swimming Training Aids</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Baby floats that are predominantly light-blue coloured, transparent, translucent, pastel, or otherwise low-contrast in appearance.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_b4bd1902-6c06-410a-b5c4-33704cb9b50b\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a390c1fc6e94f095f3efb78/2606-0178-product-recall-low-visibility-baby-floats.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk of drowning as low-visibility colours may make it difficult for caregivers or lifeguards to quickly locate the child in the water. This may delay supervision or rescue response, increasing the risk of drowning or serious injury.</p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by TikTok and the listings have been removed.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the recalled products immediately and keep them out of reach of children. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2606-0178</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-22T14:47:36Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-22","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-22T15:47:36+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-light-blue-or-low-visibility-baby-floats-sold-via-tiktok-2606-017